                        - <span class="citation">2020 SCC 18</span>
                    - <span class="report-citation">[2020] 2 SCR 413</span>
                - <span class="publicationDate">2020-07-17</span>
            </h3>
            <div class="subMetadata">
                <span>Supreme Court Judgments</span>
